description.p:
You may not legally own the 200 lines your assistant just generated, but you are still on the hook for every bug they ship. This dev covers what vendor terms actually say, and the indemnification gap in the fine print.

{ author: @Nazar19218696 }

https://t.co/fHyU4VAxXG

RAG pipelines have no causal tracking, so an LLM will link a cleanup cron job to an unrelated disk failure just because both logs landed nearby. This dev's fix anchors every claim to a source doc ID.

{ author: @tanaikech + @GoogleDevExpert }

https://t.co/C9WN9j3BDy

Showing a doctor a chart on your phone is one thing. This dev built a Python pipeline turning an Apple Health export into a structured PDF, with Gemini handling only the narrative.

{ author: @r0mymendez + @GoogleDevGroups }

